--!strict
-- Every creature family and species. Adding a species is a config entry: the server,
-- the collection journal and the model builder (client/Visuals/CreatureModels) all read
-- from here.
--
-- Stats use 10 as "average". A stat's effect is value / 10, so WorkSpeed 12 works 20%
-- faster than average. Only some stats matter for each job (see JobConfig.Stats).
--
-- `Phase` is the first development phase in which a species can actually be obtained.
-- Phase 1 hands out the three starters; the rest are designed and ready for hatching,
-- expeditions and discoveries in later phases.

